        dcterms:date "2026-10-20"^^xsd:date ;
        dcterms:description "Five dataset files are SHA-256-pinned and verified at import (L109-142), including the new `pass3_aer_growth_reference.json` (parameters, equations, five DOI-bearing sources, honesty note) and the re-pinned `paper_citations.bib` with four appended entries whose DOIs (10.1006/bulm.1999.0131, 10.1371/journal.pbio.1000420, 10.1242/dev.32.3.651, 10.1126/science.1179047) were resolved against doi.org during the loop; the dataset README documents the Pass 3 table, outputs and residuals. Deduction: growth constants (R0, l_F, t_aer_off) are modelling choices without a measured limb-bud source (-3); the Summerbell anchor is qualitative (-2)." ;
        dcterms:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-source-traceability> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/claude-fable-5-1> ;
